    {
     "type": "heading",
     "level": 1,
     "text": "Apartment interior design, custom furniture and turnkey renovation, 52 m²"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "parts": [
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "<strong>DUMSKAYA DESIGN (Bratislava, Slovakia)</strong> completed a comprehensive project for a 52 m² apartment — from developing the interior design and technical documentation to manufacturing custom furniture, carrying out a turnkey renovation, and decorating."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "The project covers the living room, bedroom, kitchen with custom interior fittings and built-in appliances, walk-in closets, entrance hall, and bathroom, as well as built-in wardrobes, shelving, and storage systems."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "The furniture for each area was designed together with the interior, tailored to the specifics of the rooms and the owners’ habits."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "Before work began, a detailed cost estimate was prepared covering renovation work, finishing materials, furniture, and appliances — so the budget was known in advance."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "The gallery features photorealistic 3D visualizations of the apartment."
      }
     ]
